# Goal: desired end-effector pose in task space.
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
float64 roll
float64 pitch
float64 yaw
---
# Result: whether the action finished successfully.
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback: progress reported while moving toward the goal pose.
float64 distance_translation
float64 distance_orientation
float64 time_elapsed
